  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-资金管理\",\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取客户或代理商账户流水明细信息。适用场景为查询客户或代理商的财务流水情况，关键配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"finance.advertiser_fund_transaction.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1780627317170250\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"auth.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用该接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1780627317170250\",\"title\":\"查询财务流水明细\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cUnMELM8\">获取客户或代理商账户流水明细信息。接口规则如下：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-EBL0wUlY\">1.假设某客户A是代理商下客户，对于A来说，如果流水类型是转账，而收款方是A则意味着是转账加款，如果付款方是A则意味着是转账退款。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-IJDKzrr3\">2.假设某客户B是直客客户，未在任何代理商下，如果交易流水类型为充值，则收款方和付款方将都显示客户B，如果金额为正则是充值交易，金额为负则是退款交易。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201768213669540875%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-5AE2A8b2\" id=\"h346b9f0-5AE2A8b2\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-lK35kldh\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1780627317170250\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TfVS6PQl\" id=\"h346b9f0-TfVS6PQl\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-faHYCgZZ\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-eZV28LBT\" id=\"h346b9f0-eZV28LBT\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oG8UX0k0\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-eK6Ii5bp\" id=\"h346b9f0-eK6Ii5bp\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fxZlxzQG\">客户/代理商ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yXRYRmLn\">开始时间，格式YYYY-MM-DD</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-J2R9rsU0\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">结束时间，格式YYYY-MM-DD</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">transaction_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9CwA5cdI\">流水类型，可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-TTMfAeL9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IOadcA91\"><code>RECHARGE</code>充值</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NdK7IeNV\"><code>TRANSFER</code>转账</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CrFJ4ynU\">页码. 默认值: <code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JXQ44CNi\">页面数据量. 默认值: <code>10</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fNaf0W7A\" id=\"h346b9f0-fNaf0W7A\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Fadvertiser%2Ffund%2Ftransaction%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20start_date%20%3D%20START_DATE%5Cn%20%20%20%20end_date%20%3D%20END_DATE%5Cn%20%20%20%20transaction_type%20%3D%20TRANSACTION_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20page%20%3D%20PAGE%5Cn%20%20%20%20page_size%20%3D%20PAGE_SIZE%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22start_date%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22end_date%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22transaction_type%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22page%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22page_size%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%5C%22%20%25%20(advertiser_id%2C%20start_date%2C%20end_date%2C%20transaction_type%2C%20page%2C%20page_size)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(get(my_args))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22import%20com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonProcessingException%3B%5Cnimport%20com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper%3B%5Cnimport%20okhttp3.*%3B%5Cnimport%20org.apache.http.client.utils.URIBuilder%3B%5Cn%5Cnimport%20java.io.IOException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URI%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URISyntaxException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URL%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.List%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.Map%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.stream.Collectors%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20class%20Demo%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20String%20ACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20String%20PATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Fadvertiser%2Ffund%2Ftransaction%2Fget%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20ObjectMapper%20mapper%20%3D%20new%20ObjectMapper()%3B